## 11. Logs and troubleshooting

### 11.1 Docker logs

```sh
docker logs --tail=300 "$HA_CONT"
docker logs --since=1h "$HA_CONT"
docker logs -f --tail=200 "$HA_CONT"
```

### 11.2 Home Assistant log files

```sh
docker exec "$HA_CONT" sh -lc 'ls -lh /config/home-assistant.log* 2>/dev/null'
docker exec "$HA_CONT" sh -lc 'tail -n 300 /config/home-assistant.log 2>/dev/null'
```

### 11.3 Error-focused log scan

```sh
docker logs --tail=1000 "$HA_CONT" 2>&1 | grep -iE 'error|exception|traceback|failed|invalid|corrupt|malformed|migration|repair|warning' | tail -n 200
```

Common log domains to search:

```sh
grep -iE 'custom_components|hacs|recorder|sqlite|zha|zigpy|zwave|matter|thread|mqtt|template|automation|script|yaml|storage' /config/home-assistant.log
```

