## 16. Custom integrations and HACS

Custom integrations live under:

```text
/config/custom_components/
```

Read-only inspection:

```sh
docker exec "$HA_CONT" sh -lc 'find /config/custom_components -maxdepth 2 -type f -name manifest.json -print 2>/dev/null'
docker logs --tail=1000 "$HA_CONT" 2>&1 | grep -iE 'custom_components|hacs|integration|manifest|deprecated|not tested' | tail -n 200
```

Rules:

- Custom integrations are a common cause of startup failures after HA updates.
- Do not delete them casually.
- If a custom integration blocks startup, propose moving the specific integration directory aside while HA is stopped.
- Keep a rollback path.

Example proposal only:

```sh
docker stop "$HA_CONT"
mv /path/to/config/custom_components/problem_integration /path/to/config/custom_components/problem_integration.disabled.$(date +%Y%m%d-%H%M%S)
docker start "$HA_CONT"
```

