## 23. Dashboards and Lovelace

Dashboards may be UI-managed in `.storage/lovelace*` or YAML-managed.

Rules:

- Determine whether the dashboard is UI or YAML mode before editing.
- Prefer UI/API for UI-managed dashboards.
- Back up `.storage/lovelace*` before manual changes.
- Validate JSON for `.storage` edits.
- Avoid large dashboard rewrites unless requested.

